  "title": "Find Out What’s New in Green Hydrogen at Plug Symposium 2022",
  "summary": "Ready to see green hydrogen at work? Plug will host its annual symposium next week from its Innovation Center and gigafactory in Rochester, N.Y. where attendees will tour the world’s first PEM electrolyzer gigafactory. The event, hosted by CEO Andy Marsh, will give in-person and virtual attendees the opportunity to witness green hydrogen at work […]",
